## Configuration

### Environment Variables

```bash
# Enable/disable the source
export AETHONX_SOURCES_{{.EnvPrefix}}_ENABLED=true

# Priority (higher = runs earlier)
export AETHONX_SOURCES_{{.EnvPrefix}}_PRIORITY={{.Priority}}

# Timeout in seconds
export AETHONX_SOURCES_{{.EnvPrefix}}_TIMEOUT={{.DefaultTimeout}}

{{- if eq .Type "CLI"}}
# Binary path (optional, defaults to PATH lookup)
export AETHONX_SOURCES_{{.EnvPrefix}}_EXEC_PATH={{.BinaryName}}
{{- end}}

{{- range .CustomConfigFields}}
# {{.Description}}
export AETHONX_SOURCES_{{$.EnvPrefix}}_{{.EnvKey}}={{.DefaultValue}}
{{- end}}
```

### CLI Flags

```bash
# Enable the source
./aethonx -t example.com --src.{{.Name}}

# Disable the source
./aethonx -t example.com --src.{{.Name}}=false

# Set priority
./aethonx -t example.com --src.{{.Name}}.priority={{.Priority}}

{{- range .CustomConfigFields}}
# {{.Description}}
./aethonx -t example.com --src.{{.Name}}.{{.Key}}={{.DefaultValue}}
{{- end}}
```

### .env File

```bash
# Add to .env file
AETHONX_SOURCES_{{.EnvPrefix}}_ENABLED=true
{{- range .CustomConfigFields}}
AETHONX_SOURCES_{{$.EnvPrefix}}_{{.EnvKey}}={{.DefaultValue}}
{{- end}}
```

